Description: graphics tablet configurator for X11 (libinput)
 GTK window and command line to configure a graphics tablet under X11 with
 the libinput driver: map the tablet to a monitor or screen area, crop the
 tablet area, rotate, keep aspect ratio, adjust the pen pressure curve and
 remap tablet and pen buttons (shortcut, mouse click, scroll, command).
 .
 Settings are kept in profiles and reapplied automatically when the tablet
 is plugged in (udev rule + systemd user services).
